{"seq":2,"slug":"registration-obligation-threshold-model","title":"注册义务判定：低值货物、B2B/B2C 与远程销售阈值建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-indirect-tax-determination-remittance/indirect-tax-regime-registration-model/registration-obligation-threshold-model","wordCount":3020,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"注册义务判定-低值货物-b2b-b2c-与远程销售阈值建模\">注册义务判定：低值货物、B2B/B2C 与远程销售阈值建模</h1><p>一家中国卖家在德国站、法国站、意大利站各开了一个店铺，单站年销售额都不到 3 万欧元，却因为三地合计超过了 1 万欧元的欧盟远程销售门槛，必须对全部三个市场按目的地税率注册并申报增值税；同一时间，它在美国加州卖了 40 万美元、在怀俄明州卖了 8 万美元，前者触发经济联结（economic nexus）、后者不触发。差别不在销售额总量，而在于<strong>判定「是否产生注册义务」的那台机器，输入的是哪个维度、哪个窗口、哪个口径的累计值</strong>。本篇把这台机器拆开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-注册义务判定是一台多输入-可版本化的规则机\">核心概念：注册义务判定是一台多输入、可版本化的规则机</h2><p>把「要不要注册」写成一个布尔配置项是最常见的建模错误。真实的注册义务由四组正交输入决定，任何一组变化都会翻转结论，必须分别存储、分别带生效期。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>输入维度</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>典型取值/来源</th>\n<th>为什么必须单独建模</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>客户性质（B2B/B2C）</td>\n<td>买方是企业还是终端消费者</td>\n<td>欧盟：B2C 走 OSS/IOSS，B2B 逆向征收</td>\n<td>B2B 跨国供货常由买方自行申报，卖家无注册义务；B2C 才归集到门槛</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交易类型（货物/服务/低值）</td>\n<td>远程销售货物、数字化服务、低值进口货物</td>\n<td>欧盟：货物远程销售 vs 电子服务 vs ≤€150 进口</td>\n<td>不同交易类型适用不同门槛与不同一站式机制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>阈值口径（measure + basis）</td>\n<td>门槛比的是金额、笔数，是否含税/含运费</td>\n<td>美国各州金额、或金额&quot;或/且&quot;笔数；欧盟 €10,000 净额</td>\n<td>口径错误导致累计值系统性偏差，是最隐蔽的错算源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计量窗口（window）</td>\n<td>滚动 12 个月、日历年、还是上一/本年度</td>\n<td>欧盟：当年度与上一年度；美国各州：上年或当季</td>\n<td>窗口定义决定何时重算以及历史订单复算依据</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>判定结果是「注册义务状态」而非单一布尔，至少三个值：<code>未触发</code>、<code>已触发待注册</code>、<code>已注册</code>。三态机是必要的，因为法规普遍给一个<strong>缓冲期</strong>：触发门槛后往往允许在若干天/月内完成注册，此前不追溯处罚。把「触发」和「已注册」合成一个状态，就无法表达缓冲期内的合法过渡态。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[交易发生] --&gt; B{客户是 B2C ?}&#10;  B -- 否 B2B --&gt; C{反向征收适用 ?}&#10;  C -- 是 --&gt; D[买家自行申报&lt;br/&gt;卖家无注册义务]&#10;  C -- 否 --&gt; E[计入卖家供货国义务]&#10;  B -- 是 --&gt; F{交易类型 ?}&#10;  F -- 低值进口货物 ≤€150 --&gt; G[IOSS 通道&lt;br/&gt;销售点代收, 不累计远程销售门槛]&#10;  F -- 远程销售货物或数字化服务 --&gt; H[累计至目的地市场阈值池]&#10;  H --&gt; J{累计值 ≥ 阈值 ?}&#10;  J -- 否 --&gt; K[状态=未触发&lt;br/&gt;按供货国规则处理]&#10;  J -- 是 --&gt; L[状态=已触发待注册&lt;br/&gt;进入缓冲期]&#10;  L --&gt; N[完成注册后状态=已注册&lt;br/&gt;按目的地税率申报]\">flowchart TD\n  A[交易发生] --&gt; B{客户是 B2C ?}\n  B -- 否 B2B --&gt; C{反向征收适用 ?}\n  C -- 是 --&gt; D[买家自行申报&lt;br/&gt;卖家无注册义务]\n  C -- 否 --&gt; E[计入卖家供货国义务]\n  B -- 是 --&gt; F{交易类型 ?}\n  F -- 低值进口货物 ≤€150 --&gt; G[IOSS 通道&lt;br/&gt;销售点代收, 不累计远程销售门槛]\n  F -- 远程销售货物或数字化服务 --&gt; H[累计至目的地市场阈值池]\n  H --&gt; J{累计值 ≥ 阈值 ?}\n  J -- 否 --&gt; K[状态=未触发&lt;br/&gt;按供货国规则处理]\n  J -- 是 --&gt; L[状态=已触发待注册&lt;br/&gt;进入缓冲期]\n  L --&gt; N[完成注册后状态=已注册&lt;br/&gt;按目的地税率申报]</pre><p>上图里有一个容易被忽略的分支：<strong>低值进口货物（欧盟 ≤€150 的 IOSS 通道）不计入远程销售门槛池</strong>。因为 IOSS 本身就在销售点代收了增值税，它是一条独立的征收通道，不参与「跨过门槛后切换征税国」的累计逻辑。把它和远程销售货物混入同一个计数器，会导致卖家在远未达到真实门槛时误判为已触发。</p>\n<h2 id=\"欧盟-10-000-远程销售门槛与-b2b-b2c-的分岔点\">欧盟：€10,000 远程销售门槛与 B2B/B2C 的分岔点</h2><p>欧盟的注册义务判定围绕《增值税指令》（Council Directive 2006/112/EC）第 59c 条展开：自 2021 年 7 月 1 日起，向其他成员国的<strong>非纳税义务人（B2C）<strong>远程销售货物，若</strong>当年度及上一年度全欧盟合计</strong>不超过 10,000 欧元，可继续按供货商所在国规则征税；一旦超过，全部面向其他成员国的 B2C 远程销售即须按<strong>买方所在成员国</strong>税率征税，并通过**一站式申报（OSS，Union scheme）**在供货国注册地申报所有成员国税额。</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 为卖家、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 为客户所在成员国、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 为时间窗口，阈值累计可形式化为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></munder><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></munder><mtext>net_sales</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>m</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>liable</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≥</mo><mtext>€</mtext><mn>10,000</mn><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C(s, p) = \\sum_{m \\neq m_0} \\sum_{t \\in W(p)} \\text{net\\_sales}(s, m, t), \\qquad\n\\text{liable}(s,p) = \\mathbb{1}\\!\\left[ C(s,p) \\ge €10{,}000 \\right]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.566em;vertical-align:-1.516em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\"><span class=\"mrel mtight\"><span class=\"mord vbox mtight\"><span class=\"thinbox mtight\"><span class=\"rlap mtight\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mrel mtight\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak mtight\"></span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span></span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3173em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4382em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.809em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.516em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">net_sales</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">liable</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">€10</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W(p)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是「当年度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∪</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\cup</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∪</span></span></span></span></span> 上一年度」这个<strong>并集窗口</strong>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>net_sales</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{net\\_sales}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">net_sales</span></span></span></span></span></span> 是不含增值税的净额。两个建模要点：<strong>口径是净额、跨全部成员国合计</strong>，不是单市场累计也不是含税订单额；<strong>窗口是当年度与上年度的并集，而非滚动 12 个月</strong>，跨年时旧年度份额滑出窗口的时点与滚动窗口不同，必须按日历年边界重算。</p>\n<p>B2B 一侧走完全不同的路径。面向欧盟企业的跨国货物供应通常适用<strong>逆向征收（reverse charge）</strong>：由买方按自国税率自行申报，卖方不产生目的地注册义务（仍需在发票上标注买方有效 VAT 号、做 EC Sales List 申报）。因此判定机的第一个分岔就是客户性质——有有效 VAT 号的 B2B 交易不进 B2C 门槛池，若被错误计入会造成门槛虚高、提前触发注册。</p>\n<p>IOSS 的 150 欧元门槛（同指令第 369l 条范围）则是低值进口的<strong>准入条件</strong>而非累计阈值：内在价值 ≤€150 才可走 IOSS 销售点代收，超过则退出该通道、转常规进口清关。它与 €10,000 远程销售门槛数值不同、法律依据不同、判定方向也不同（一个是准入上限，一个是义务下限），工程上必须分字段存储。欧盟正在推进的 ViDA 改革将扩展 OSS/IOSS 适用范围，横跨 2027 至 2035 年，系统应以「机制可插拔 + 生效期」预留。</p>\n<h2 id=\"美国-wayfair-经济联结与-金额-笔数-阈值的状态机\">美国：Wayfair 经济联结与「金额/笔数」阈值的状态机</h2><p>美国没有联邦层面的销售税注册门槛，判定权在各州，依据是 2018 年 <strong>South Dakota v. Wayfair, Inc., 138 S. Ct. 2080</strong> 判决——它推翻了 Quill 案确立的「物理存在（physical presence）」要求，允许各州对在本州<strong>经济存在</strong>达阈值的远程卖家课征销售税征收义务。</p>\n<p>各州阈值口径差异极大，建模时必须把「金额」「笔数」「逻辑连接词」三者分开：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>州（示例）</th>\n<th>金额阈值</th>\n<th>笔数阈值</th>\n<th>逻辑</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>South Dakota</td>\n<td>$100,000</td>\n<td>200 笔</td>\n<td>或（OR）</td>\n<td>Wayfair 案原案由所在州，SDCL 10-64</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>New York</td>\n<td>$500,000</td>\n<td>100 笔</td>\n<td>且（AND）</td>\n<td>金额与笔数同时满足才触发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>California</td>\n<td>$500,000</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>仅金额</td>\n<td>不含笔数条件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Texas</td>\n<td>$500,000</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>仅金额</td>\n<td>以 12 个月滚动计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多数州</td>\n<td>$100,000</td>\n<td>200 笔</td>\n<td>或（OR）</td>\n<td>沿用南达科他模型</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>阈值判定可写成「或/且」两种逻辑的统一形式。设金额累计 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>、笔数累计 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>，阈值为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>N</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_A, T_N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>nexus</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>∨</mo><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>OR 型州（如 SD）</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>∧</mo><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>AND 型州（如 NY）</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{nexus}(s) =\n\\begin{cases}\n\\mathbb{1}[A \\ge T_A] \\lor \\mathbb{1}[N \\ge T_N] &amp; \\text{OR 型州（如 SD）}\\\\[4pt]\n\\mathbb{1}[A \\ge T_A] \\land \\mathbb{1}[N \\ge T_N] &amp; \\text{AND 型州（如 NY）}\n\\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">nexus</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.28em;vertical-align:-1.39em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.89em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.89em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∨</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.39em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.89em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.89em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">OR </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">型州（如</span><span class=\"mord\"> SD</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">）</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">AND </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">型州（如</span><span class=\"mord\"> NY</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">）</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.39em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>需要注意三个只在工程里才暴露的细节：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>笔数的粒度。</strong> 各州对「一笔」的定义不同：有的按发票、有的按发运、有的按商品行。判定机必须允许按州配置计数粒度。</li>\n<li><strong>金额是否含税、是否含运费。</strong> 多数州以**总销售额（gross）**计，但各州对运费与折扣的处理不同；口径错一处，跨阈值时点就整体偏移。</li>\n<li><strong>市场促进者法改变了归属。</strong> 全美已有 40 余州及华盛顿特区立法，规定由平台（而非第三方卖家）对平台促成的销售承担征收与申报义务。卖家在平台上的销售额<strong>是否仍计入自身联结累计</strong>，各州规则不一，系统必须对「自营站点销售额」与「平台销售额」分别建模并保留归属标记，否则会重复或漏注册。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"阈值判定的系统工程-滚动累计-缓冲期与状态迁移\">阈值判定的系统工程：滚动累计、缓冲期与状态迁移</h2><p>把上述法域规则统一到一套判定引擎，核心是三个可复用的构件：<strong>带口径的累计器、带窗口的重算器、带缓冲期的状态机</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>累计器。</strong> 每个「卖家 × 辖区 × 客户性质 × 交易类型」维护一个聚合桶，记录金额与笔数两个计数，并保留口径元数据（含税与否、含运费与否、计数粒度）。订单落成时增量累加，退货/取消时按原期间做负向调整——<strong>不能只在当期冲抵</strong>，否则历史窗口的累计值会失真。</p>\n<p><strong>重算器。</strong> 阈值是否满足会随时间自然滑出窗口。日历年型（欧盟）与滚动 12 个月型（如德州、南达科他）需要在窗口边界事件上触发全量重算，而非依赖增量值，并与增量结果做断言校验：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>assert</mtext><mo>:</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mtext>counter</mtext><mtext>incremental</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></munder><mtext>order_value</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{assert}:\\quad \\text{counter}_{\\text{incremental}}(s, j, p) = \\sum_{t \\in W(p)} \\text{order\\_value}(s, j, t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">assert</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">counter</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">incremental</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.566em;vertical-align:-1.516em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.809em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.516em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">order_value</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>一旦不等，说明有漏计（如某渠道订单未接入）或错计（归属州判定错误），必须在义务触发前定位。</p>\n<p><strong>状态机。</strong> 承接前文的缓冲期：触发阈值后进入 <code>已触发待注册</code>，法规通常给出注册与起征的过渡规则。状态迁移必须带生效时点与触发依据（哪一次重算、哪个窗口、哪份规则版本），以便事后解释「当时为什么判定需要注册」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[增量累加订单] --&gt; B{窗口边界事件 ?}&#10;  B -- 是 --&gt; C[按窗口全量重算]&#10;  B -- 否 --&gt; D[使用增量计数]&#10;  C --&gt; E{累计器 = 重算值 ?}&#10;  D --&gt; E&#10;  E -- 不等 --&gt; F[定位漏计/错计并告警&lt;br/&gt;义务触发前修复]&#10;  E -- 相等 --&gt; G{达到阈值 ?}&#10;  G -- 否 --&gt; H[状态保持 未触发]&#10;  G -- 是 --&gt; I[状态=已触发待注册&lt;br/&gt;记录触发依据+规则版本]&#10;  I --&gt; J[缓冲期内完成注册]&#10;  J --&gt; K[状态=已注册&lt;br/&gt;按目的地税率申报]\">flowchart TD\n  A[增量累加订单] --&gt; B{窗口边界事件 ?}\n  B -- 是 --&gt; C[按窗口全量重算]\n  B -- 否 --&gt; D[使用增量计数]\n  C --&gt; E{累计器 = 重算值 ?}\n  D --&gt; E\n  E -- 不等 --&gt; F[定位漏计/错计并告警&lt;br/&gt;义务触发前修复]\n  E -- 相等 --&gt; G{达到阈值 ?}\n  G -- 否 --&gt; H[状态保持 未触发]\n  G -- 是 --&gt; I[状态=已触发待注册&lt;br/&gt;记录触发依据+规则版本]\n  I --&gt; J[缓冲期内完成注册]\n  J --&gt; K[状态=已注册&lt;br/&gt;按目的地税率申报]</pre><p>四个高发失败模式值得在引擎里做成显式分支而非兜底日志：<strong>多店铺/多渠道未合并累计</strong>（欧盟按卖家合计、部分美国州按关联方合计，拆分店铺会系统性低估）；<strong>货币口径未统一</strong>（累计需折算到门槛币种，汇率取值时点须固定，混用会漂移跨阈值时点）；<strong>B2B 误入 B2C 池</strong>（有效 VAT 号未校验就并入累计，导致门槛虚高）；<strong>平台销售额归属误判</strong>（把已由平台代扣的平台销售额重复计入自身累计，造成重复注册与申报）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"落地建议-把注册义务做成-计算-决策-分离的两个模块\">落地建议：把注册义务做成「计算 + 决策」分离的两个模块</h2><p>建议把注册义务判定拆成两个职责单一的部分。<strong>计算模块</strong>只回答「某卖家在某辖区、某客户性质下的累计金额与笔数是多少」，它不知道门槛、不产生结论，纯粹是带口径与窗口的聚合。<strong>决策模块</strong>持有各辖区的规则（阈值、逻辑连接词、窗口类型、B2B 豁免、低值分档），输入计算结果输出三态义务状态与触发依据。分离的好处是：法规变更（阈值调整、新增 ViDA 机制、新州立法）只改决策模块的规则数据；数据接入变更（新增渠道、订单源）只改计算模块。</p>\n<p>同时保留两个不可省的工程习惯：<strong>规则版本随判定结果落库</strong>，以及<strong>累计器与重算器的对账断言自动化</strong>（在义务触发传播到注册与申报之前把它截住）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>注册义务判定是<strong>多输入三态机</strong>，不是布尔配置：客户性质、交易类型、阈值口径（金额/笔数、含税与否、或/且逻辑）、计量窗口四组输入独立变化，结果至少三态（未触发 / 已触发待注册 / 已注册）以承载缓冲期。</li>\n<li>欧盟侧：€10,000 是<strong>跨全部成员国合计的净额、当年度与上年度并集窗口</strong>的门槛，超过则全部 B2C 远程销售按目的地税率经 OSS 申报；≤€150 的 IOSS 是<strong>准入上限</strong>而非累计门槛，两者不可混为一个字段。</li>\n<li>美国侧：Wayfair（138 S. Ct. 2080）确立经济联结，各州阈值在金额/笔数/逻辑连接词上差异极大；市场促进者法把平台销售的征收义务转移给平台，但<strong>是否仍计入卖家自身联结累计因州而异</strong>。</li>\n<li>工程上抓住三点即可覆盖绝大多数差错：计算与决策分层、累计器与重算器断言对账、触发状态与规则版本随结果落库。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-同-hub\">延伸阅读（同 hub）</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"./\">本章目录：跨境间接税制度与注册义务模型</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../tax-determination-engine/\">下一章目录：计税引擎</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../checkout-collection-invoice-record/\">实践章目录：结账征收、发票与留痕</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"注册义务判定：低值货物、B2B/B2C 与远程销售阈值建模","id":"注册义务判定-低值货物-b2b-b2c-与远程销售阈值建模"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：注册义务判定是一台多输入、可版本化的规则机","id":"核心概念-注册义务判定是一台多输入-可版本化的规则机"},{"level":2,"text":"欧盟：€10,000 远程销售门槛与 B2B/B2C 的分岔点","id":"欧盟-10-000-远程销售门槛与-b2b-b2c-的分岔点"},{"level":2,"text":"美国：Wayfair 经济联结与「金额/笔数」阈值的状态机","id":"美国-wayfair-经济联结与-金额-笔数-阈值的状态机"},{"level":2,"text":"阈值判定的系统工程：滚动累计、缓冲期与状态迁移","id":"阈值判定的系统工程-滚动累计-缓冲期与状态迁移"},{"level":2,"text":"落地建议：把注册义务做成「计算 + 决策」分离的两个模块","id":"落地建议-把注册义务做成-计算-决策-分离的两个模块"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读（同 hub）","id":"延伸阅读-同-hub"}],"prev":{"title":"IOSS/OSS/VoEC 与英美销售税制度矩阵及申报口径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-indirect-tax-determination-remittance/indirect-tax-regime-registration-model/ioss-oss-vat-regime-matrix"},"next":{"title":"税号生命周期与多辖区并存治理：注册、变更与注销","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-indirect-tax-determination-remittance/indirect-tax-regime-registration-model/tax-id-lifecycle-multi-jurisdiction"}}